OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786196871
OL,3,CEbbsfleet United suspended by National
OL,4,CLeague over unpaid debts
OL,6,FEbbsfleet United have been suspended
OL,7,Fby the National League for the first
OL,8,Fthree matches of the season over
OL,9,Funpaid debts.
OL,11,FThe League held a meeting on Wednesday
OL,12,Fevening (5 August) where they made the
OL,13,Fdecision the matches would be
OL,14,Fpostponed until a later date.
OL,16,FEbbsfleet were given a winding-up
OL,17,Fpetition over unpaid tax debts, but
OL,18,Fthe club say they were assured that
OL,19,Fthe debt would be cleared in time for
OL,20,Fthe new season.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
