OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786196871
OL,3,CEbbsfleet United suspended by National
OL,4,CLeague over unpaid debts
OL,6,FBut the League has raised concerns
OL,7,Fabout budgeting for the upcoming
OL,8,Fseason, as well as the the club's
OL,9,Ffinancial viability, with the recent
OL,10,Foverturning of the Northfleet
OL,11,FHarbourside development.
OL,13,FThe League have provided the owners
OL,14,Funtil 10am on 19 August to rectify its
OL,15,Fposition and demonstrate this to the
OL,16,FLeague.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
