OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786196871
OL,3,CEbbsfleet United suspended by National
OL,4,CLeague over unpaid debts
OL,6,FThe club spokesperson added:
OL,7,F"Obviously, for our playing group,
OL,8,Fmanagement, staff and most importantly
OL,9,Fsupporters, this has come as a shock
OL,10,Fand is extremely upsetting.
OL,12,F"Obviously our players, staff and
OL,13,Fsupporters have taken a number of
OL,14,Fblows in the last week, none of which
OL,15,Fis within their control or a result of
OL,16,Ftheir work or actions, and we ask for
OL,17,Funderstanding and care during this
OL,18,Ftime while the ownership situation is
OL,19,Fsolved.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
